Title: Press Kit - Apache Traffic Server


<h2>Press Kit</h2>
If you intend to use the Apache Traffic Server logo or icon for press releases, articles, or other publications,
feel free to use any of the images below:

<div class="row container text-center">
    <div class="col">

        <!-- Traffic Server Logo Section -->
        <img src="/static/images/ts_logo_tm_380x73.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Traffic Server Logo, Small (380x73)">
        <div class="row mt-4">
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/ts_logo_tm_380x73.png">Small (380x73)</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/ts_logo_tm_1024x196.png">Medium (1024x196)</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/ts_logo_tm_1960x375.png">Large (1960x375)</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/trafficserver.svg">SVG</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Traffic Server Icon Section -->
        <img src="/static/images/tsicon_small.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Traffic Server Icon, Small">
        <div class="row mt-3">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/tsicon_small.png">Small</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/tsicon.png">Medium</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <p class="text-center"><a href="/static/images/tsicon_large.png">Large</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>